WEBVTT

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:10.700
If at any time, I lose the "human" part

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:10.700
of me and go berserk...use this.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.410
Zero...

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:11.080
To seek power and grasp power...

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.160
TWO SOULS

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.160
That is the true nature of vampires.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:31.620
As long as Rido is alive, he will

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:31.620
come after us, wanting to devour Yuki.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.750
Will you persist in

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.750
pretending not to know?

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:49.410
That those things inside your body

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:49.410
have begun to pulsate?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:03.160
Ichiru...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.910
The time has come, Zero.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.080
Rima...

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.830
I heard your voice

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.830
that time, Rima.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:47.000
You fool! Letting people

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:47.000
have their way with you!

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:52.910
You have to love yourself more!

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.040
Thank you.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.040
You're such a headache, really.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.450
Huh?

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.450
Yes, I want to eat.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.370
I have an uneasy feeling...

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.410
Something strange has

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.410
entered the dorm.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.290
Is it the work of the same man

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.290
who entered your body?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:28.950
Probably.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.450
Where's Ichijo?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.950
He's going to do

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.950
what must be done.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.200
Are you all right, Ruka?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:21.750
Yes.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:30.750
I don't like being jumped

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:30.750
by males, you know?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.000
Hanabusa!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.620
Aren't you supposed to

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.620
be with Lady Yuki?

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.790
Err...Umm...

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.790
She disappeared, so...

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.660
What are you doing?!

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.660
The enemy is after her!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.040
The Dorm President will

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.040
kill you this time, for sure.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.450
I-It's gonna be all right for now...

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.750
How do you know that?

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.700
I mean...

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.700
The enemy is a Pureblood.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.620
If he's serious, he won't stop

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.620
by just attacking like this.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:04.580
Which means, he either totally

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:04.580
underestimated our strength or...

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.790
You think he's waiting

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.790
for something else?

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.080
Today, we're celebrating

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.080
my resurrection.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:21.200
Don't hold back.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:21.200
Enjoy yourselves thoroughly.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.500
Geez... The crowd keeps coming.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:35.580
This aura... It's...

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.290
What's going on?

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.660
Why can't we go back?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:48.750
Silence! We cannot leave this hall

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:48.750
until the Headmaster says so!

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.790
I don't know the reason either!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.950
May I help you,

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.950
Society President?

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.120
That's a dangerous thing

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.120
you have there.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.950
Didn't you say you weren't

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.950
ever going to carry it again?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.500
I must protect my students.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:16.410
Be good and hand over

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:16.410
Zero Kiryu to us.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.870
I'm sorry I can't do that.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.040
I see... In that case...

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:38.950
That was foolish.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:38.950
I had given you one last chance...

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.950
Now you will see hell!

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.040
Unfortunately, I prefer to

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.040
create my own chance.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:59.160
Come together,

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:59.160
then devour each other.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.620
That is the true nature of vampires.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:14.250
Many people are coming

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:14.250
to congratulate me.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:16.870
Those people...

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.660
and those people too.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:23.950
Aren't you coming too?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.000
Hurry and give me

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:28.000
some entertainment.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.580
Zero and Ichiru Kiryu...

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:40.290
The time is here.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:40.290
You must fulfill your duty.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.450
That is why I let you live...

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.450
For Yuki's sake.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.500
Ichiru... You...

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:03.950
Zero...

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.950
The smell of this blood...

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.950
It can't be...?!

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:38.870
Zero!

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:50.910
You are hopeless.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.410
You want to go to Kiryu,

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.410
is that it?

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.160
Oh...

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:02.540
Kaname...

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:10.830
Kiryu is trying to resurrect himself...

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:10.830
in order to protect you, Yuki.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:13.750
What do you mean?

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.330
Rido...Kuran?

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:25.330
In order to protect you

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:25.330
from him, I used Kiryu.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:27.290
And...

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.660
I also killed Hio Shizuka...

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:30.910
Huh?!

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.250
I'm sorry, Yuki.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:45.160
In trying to protect you,

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:45.160
I have hurt you the most.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.200
I'm sorry.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:05.250
Why were we born as two?

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.250
I wish you and I had been born as one.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:10.790
Huh?

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.160
If I knew I was going to

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.160
be born so inadequate...

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.200
I...

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:20.290
I'm sorry!

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:24.290
Oww... I hit my head.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.250
I'm sorry, Ichiru... I'm sorry.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:33.000
I just bumped my head.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:33.000
No need to apologize so much.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:40.410
I say these things,

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:40.410
knowing how Zero will feel.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:46.200
It's only in these moments,

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:46.200
when Zero feels pain because of me

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.250
that I get the sense of where I belong.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.750
You know that too, Zero.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:01.660
I don't know what I can do, Ichiru.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.330
Even though I know how you feel,

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.330
I don't know what I can do,

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.330
what I should do.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:10.750
I don't know...

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.830
Because the reason why you

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.830
were born so weak is...probably...

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.120
MY FAULT

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.950
...while we were

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.950
in our mother's womb,

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:25.370
I took something from you

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:25.370
and made it mine.

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.750
JUST LIKE A VAMPIRE

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.660
Hey Zero,

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.660
what are you thinking now?

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:34.330
Shall I guess?

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:35.580
Huh?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.200
You get too agitated.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:43.000
How can you be a cool and strong

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:43.000
Vampire Hunter like that?

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:48.080
Zero, there are things

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:48.080
we know too much about,

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.830
so we don't say anything.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.660
That's why little by little...

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:54.830
Little by little...

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.450
the wheel started to turn.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:00.660
Ichiru, you didn't

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:00.660
take your medicine yet.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:08.080
Having you near me makes me

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:08.080
feel better than medicine.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:14.540
I'll try to do whatever Ichiru wants.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:18.040
I'm home.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.540
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.250
Good night, Ichiru.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.250
Good night, Zero.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:30.290
Stop it, Mother.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.410
The love that you share

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.410
equally between us,

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.040
should all go to Ichiru.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:41.330
Give it to Ichiru. I have already

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:41.330
taken too much from him.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.000
I...

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.080
CANNOT BE LOVED

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.160
Zero...

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.370
Don't pass out.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.370
Look at me.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.200
Behaving yourself

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.200
in a place like this...

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:02.500
Just like before... You never

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:02.500
stopped blaming yourself.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:04.370
Is that your way of atoning?

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:10.080
I hope you don't think

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:10.080
that made me feel any better?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.620
Thanks to you, I realized

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.620
even though I didn't want to...

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:19.250
That if I did not exist,

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:19.250
you would be freer.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.120
This does nothing to

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.120
make me feel better

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.040
about Lady Shizuka

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.040
being taken away!

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:31.870
Relax. I forgot about something silly

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:31.870
like atonement long ago.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:37.330
That night...

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:37.330
when I saw you smile...

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.200
How could you smile?

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.200
About Mom and Dad's deaths?!

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.370
Could it be...?

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.370
Are you starting to lose control?

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.870
I didn't wish for them to die.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:04.290
The man Lady Shizuka loved

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:04.290
was hunted down by our parents.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.290
He hadn't lapsed into Level E,

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.290
but his name was on the list.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:15.330
They weren't to blame.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:15.330
They were just following orders.

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.500
But upon learning the truth,

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.500
I felt disgusted.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.870
On the very day that

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.870
they killed Lady Shizuka's lover...

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.160
they came home

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.160
and hugged us tightly.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:35.540
His physical weakness will be

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:35.540
a serious liability as a Vampire Hunter.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.450
Yes...

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.250
In time, Ichiru will not be able to

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.250
walk the same path as Zero.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.370
And they'd look at me sometimes

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:47.370
with the eyes of Society lackeys,

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.250
and that hurt so much.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.830
I'll ask you

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.830
one more question, Ichiru.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:58.000
Why are you hurt so badly?

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:05.790
I just wanted to

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:05.790
fulfill Lady Shizuka's wish...

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.290
From the beginning,

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.290
he was my only target.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.580
The vampire who

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.580
locked Lady Shizuka away

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.080
and put her lover's name

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.080
on the Hunter list.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.000
Rido Kuran...

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.620
Let me at least ask

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.620
why you are doing this?

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.870
I wanted to take

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.870
the place of Lady Shizuka

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.410
from whom you took everything...

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.660
and get a blow in!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.250
That is why I have

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.250
prayed for your resurrection!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.290
Leave.

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.290
I have no use for weaklings.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.790
I was fully aware that

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.790
even if I gave it my all,

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:50.250
there was a limit to

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:50.250
what I could do.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:17:00.660
I'm so useless...

00:16:54.120 --> 00:17:00.660
Did I have anything else to tell you?

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:02.700
Ichiru...

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.040
This place is disgusting...

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.040
It reeks with the smell of our blood.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:16.750
I guess to you it's addicting.

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:20.120
You're holding up pretty well.

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:24.660
You've become a different being...

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.870
but when you hold me like this,

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.870
I feel so calm.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:36.000
This is proof, isn't it?

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:36.000
That we came from the same egg?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:44.330
Zero...eat whatever life

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:44.330
there is of me left.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.700
What are you saying?!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:52.830
If you do that, you'll regain everything

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:52.830
you were supposed to be born with.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.830
And perhaps, you'll be able to control

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.830
the urges running rampant inside you.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.790
I will not! I cannot!

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:05.790
No, you will.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:12.120
Why do you think I shot you

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:12.120
with the Bloody Rose?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.910
No! Stop this!

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:17.950
I can't lose another...!

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:20.450
I'm so happy.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:26.830
I thought that I was

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:26.830
long dead in your heart.

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:30.080
Maria longed to see you too.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:32.160
Really?

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.830
Mom and Dad too...

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:39.830
They watched over you

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:39.830
and loved you so much.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.700
I know...

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:46.040
Zero, you don't have to

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:46.040
forgive Lady Shizuka...

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.580
but please don't hate her.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:55.750
Lady Shizuka really treated me

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:55.750
like I was valued.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:01.950
That's why I don't regret it.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:01.950
And besides...

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.950
Ichiru, this is wrong!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.330
Wrong?

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.870
If you believe that, Zero...

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.910
You...must live

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.910
and fulfill your goal!

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:43.830
Even if I gave the rest of my life

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:43.830
for Yuki's sake...

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.540
I'd have no regrets.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.790
Soon...

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.290
You and I will be one again, Zero.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.370
What's the matter, Zero Kiryu?

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.330
Come. Let us dance together.

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:42.660
If you don't hurry,

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:42.660
the Kuran Princess is...

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.200
This is wrong!

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:54.000
If you believe that, Zero...

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:59.200
fulfill your goal!

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:22.870
I must go and do what I must.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:27.450
Yuki, you must do

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:27.450
what you must.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:17.000
Lord Kaname...

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:22.830
Yes, that's right.

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:25.750
You go fulfill your goal...

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:27.410
Zero Kiryu.

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:05.660
Next time:

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:05.660
"World's End"
